{"name": "positive_daemonset_shape_system_ns", "kind": "positive", "why": "Procedure C: a bare pod created with an explicit DaemonSet/Job-shaped name (base-<suffix 5>) in kube-system by a non-node user; an explicitly-named bare pod in a control-plane namespace is itself anomalous. Fires via sel_system_namespace and sel_name_daemonset.", "source": "real: local kube-apiserver v1.36.4 lab, `kubectl apply` of a pause pod kube-proxy-x7k2q in namespace kube-system, labelled trr=trr9031 (verb=create, no subresource; the marker is the label, not the name).", "events": [{"kind": "Event", "apiVersion": "audit.k8s.io/v1", "level": "Request", "auditID": "b36dfed9-88c7-4908-a7d5-83e83311df28", "stage": "ResponseComplete", "requestURI": "/api/v1/namespaces/kube-system/pods?fieldManager=kubectl-client-side-apply&fieldValidation=Strict", "verb": "create", "user": {"username": "kubernetes-admin", "uid": "uid-admin", "groups": ["kubeadm:cluster-admins", "system:masters", "system:authenticated"]}, "sourceIPs": ["127.0.0.1"], "userAgent": "kubectl/v1.36.4 (linux/amd64) kubernetes/bb826b1", "objectRef": {"resource": "pods", "namespace": "kube-system", "name": "kube-proxy-x7k2q", "apiVersion": "v1"}, "responseStatus": {"metadata": {}, "code": 201}, "requestObject": {"kind": "Pod", "apiVersion": "v1", "metadata": {"name": "kube-proxy-x7k2q", "namespace": "kube-system", "labels": {"trr": "trr9031"}, "annotations": {"kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration": "{\"apiVersion\":\"v1\",\"kind\":\"Pod\",\"metadata\":{\"annotations\":{},\"labels\":{\"trr\":\"trr9031\"},\"name\":\"kube-proxy-x7k2q\",\"namespace\":\"kube-system\"},\"spec\":{\"containers\":[{\"image\":\"registry.k8s.io/pause:3.10\",\"name\":\"c\"}]}}\n"}}, "spec": {"containers": [{"name": "c", "image": "registry.k8s.io/pause:3.10", "resources": {}, "terminationMessagePath": "/dev/termination-log", "terminationMessagePolicy": "File", "imagePullPolicy": "IfNotPresent"}], "restartPolicy": "Always", "terminationGracePeriodSecon