{"name": "positive_fake_owner_references", "kind": "positive", "why": "Provenance robustness: the same explicit ReplicaSet-shaped create, but with client-set metadata.ownerReferences pointing at a fabricated ReplicaSet (controller:true). ownerReferences are client-settable, so they are not a trusted discriminator; the rule reads only the server-set objectRef fields and still fires. An adversary cannot evade by forging provenance.", "source": "real: local kube-apiserver v1.36.4 lab, `kubectl apply` of payments-api-7d9fb8c6c4-m4r9t in trr9031 with a fabricated ReplicaSet ownerReference (payments-api-7d9fb8c6c4).", "events": [{"kind": "Event", "apiVersion": "audit.k8s.io/v1", "level": "Request", "auditID": "efe43a56-5829-476f-b484-6cbb8929f17f", "stage": "ResponseComplete", "requestURI": "/api/v1/namespaces/trr9031/pods?fieldManager=kubectl-client-side-apply&fieldValidation=Strict", "verb": "create", "user": {"username": "kubernetes-admin", "uid": "uid-admin", "groups": ["kubeadm:cluster-admins", "system:masters", "system:authenticated"]}, "sourceIPs": ["127.0.0.1"], "userAgent": "kubectl/v1.36.4 (linux/amd64) kubernetes/bb826b1", "objectRef": {"resource": "pods", "namespace": "trr9031", "name": "payments-api-7d9fb8c6c4-m4r9t", "apiVersion": "v1"}, "responseStatus": {"metadata": {}, "code": 201}, "requestObject": {"kind": "Pod", "apiVersion": "v1", "metadata": {"name": "payments-api-7d9fb8c6c4-m4r9t", "namespace": "trr9031", "labels": {"trr": "trr9031"}, "annotations": {"kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration": "{\"apiVersion\":\"v1\",\"kind\":\"Pod\",\"metadata\":{\"annotations\":{},\"labels\":{\"trr\":\"trr9031\"},\"name\":\"payments-api-7d9fb8c6c4-m4r9t\",\"namespace\":\"trr9031\",\"ownerReferences\":[{\"apiVersion\":\"apps/v1\",\"blockOwnerDeletion\":true,\"controller\":true,\"kind\":\"ReplicaSet\",\"name\":\"payments-api-7d9fb8c6c4\",\"uid\":\"11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555\"}]},\"spec\":{\"containers\":[{\"image\":\"registry.k8s.io/pause:3.10\",\"