{"name": "confounder_ci_agent_pod", "kind": "confounder", "why": "A CI runner creates an explicitly-named ephemeral agent pod build-agent-x7k2q in the application namespace ci: it shares the surface and even a '-<5>' tail, but it is not in a control-plane namespace, so branch (c) does not apply, and the name is a single suffix, not the ReplicaSet double-suffix, so branch (a) does not apply. A routine developer/CI pattern the rule leaves alone.", "source": "real: local kube-apiserver v1.36.4 lab, `kubectl run` of build-agent-x7k2q in namespace ci.", "events": [{"kind": "Event", "apiVersion": "audit.k8s.io/v1", "level": "Request", "auditID": "e995a983-a545-4ea4-8035-f1832790e8b4", "stage": "ResponseComplete", "requestURI": "/api/v1/namespaces/ci/pods?fieldManager=kubectl-run", "verb": "create", "user": {"username": "kubernetes-admin", "uid": "uid-admin", "groups": ["kubeadm:cluster-admins", "system:masters", "system:authenticated"]}, "sourceIPs": ["127.0.0.1"], "userAgent": "kubectl/v1.36.4 (linux/amd64) kubernetes/bb826b1", "objectRef": {"resource": "pods", "namespace": "ci", "name": "build-agent-x7k2q", "apiVersion": "v1"}, "responseStatus": {"metadata": {}, "code": 201}, "requestObject": {"kind": "Pod", "apiVersion": "v1", "metadata": {"name": "build-agent-x7k2q", "labels": {"run": "build-agent-x7k2q"}}, "spec": {"containers": [{"name": "build-agent-x7k2q", "image": "registry.k8s.io/pause:3.10", "resources": {}, "terminationMessagePath": "/dev/termination-log", "terminationMessagePolicy": "File", "imagePullPolicy": "IfNotPresent"}], "restartPolicy": "Never", "terminationGracePeriodSeconds": 30, "dnsPolicy": "ClusterFirst", "securityContext": {}, "schedulerName": "default-scheduler", "enableServiceLinks": true}, "status": {}}, "requestReceivedTimestamp": "2026-11-01T03:01:49.090049Z", "stageTimestamp": "2026-11-01T03:01:49.100049Z", "annotations": {"authorization.k8s.io/decision": "allow", "authorization.k8s.io/reason": "", "pod-security.kubernetes.io/enforce-policy